CM_ SG_ 770 SX_socMin "VERIFY: some sources label bits 0-9 as UI SoC.";
CM_ SG_ 1778 SX_brickMux "0-23: four brick voltages each (96 bricks); 24-31: four module temperatures each (32 sensors).";
